    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You're back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "So, did you think things through, or...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "You wanted this, right? Take it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You acted unilaterally, without permission."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I do not interfere in the private affairs of our operators, nor do I ask them what they did in their free time - as long as they do not tarnish Rhodes Island's reputation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I hope that whatever you did does not cost you your position in Rhodes Island, Skadi."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I'm not here for your snide remarks. I'm well aware of the rules. You needed something from me, and I need something from you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "What do you want from me then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Information."
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
            "image": "ac1_ex6",
            "x": -100,
            "y": 0,
            "xscale": 1.2,
            "yscale": 1.2,
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "imagetween",
        "params": {
            "xfrom": -100,
            "yfrom": 0,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "xscalefrom": 1.2,
            "yscalefrom": 1.2,
            "xscale": 1.2,
            "yscale": 1.2,
            "duration": 10,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Do you consider the information I have to be worth as little as this key?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I can crush this stone in my palm in a heartbeat. I'm sure you don't want that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "What I do know is that you went to Dewville in Kazimierz under pretenses of being on a mission, and even got into a conflict with a fellow operator."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "She kept quiet about what happened both there and at Rhodes Island for your sake. But in fact, I never assigned any such mission to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Hmm? The core has already been filled with blood. This is not your blood. You wouldn't dare shed your own blood onto this soil."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "It's Grani's blood."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You've already done something like this..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I'll repay her. You don't need to remind me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I know this is what you need. A key, a core, a memory block... whatever it might be. I just have to obtain it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "'Skull,' 'Flamelung,' 'Yellow Smog'... I took them all out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Otherwise, they surely would have taken this item. You wouldn't be able to barter with them, because you can't give them what they want."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "You need this 'stone,' and I need the information you have."
    },
