    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "What a farce. I don't need any of these... components... to form the full picture."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You're bound to Rhodes Island by contract, and you're bound to me likewise."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "You give me what I need, and I give you what you need."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I rarely see you this aggressive. Where's your usual laziness and snark?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You want to know where Spectre's Originium nerve agent came from."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "...How'd you find out?"
    },
